# Outcome delivery

The approved Outcome Spec, Trial plan, approval evidence and delivery ledger remain host-owned by Pritha.

This project may be changed by the bounded build executor, but it must not treat `delivery/outcome-lineage.json` as permission to rewrite the goal or verifier. Run delivery from Pritha with `node scripts/pritha.mjs deliver <outcome-spec> --project <this-project>`. Machine verification, user acceptance, merge and deployment are separate states.
